<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Jan 23.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Jan 23.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Armed robbers stole 600,000 meticais from the public water supply offices in Maputo during a lunchtime raid.</p>
<p>- All 50 buses and trucks stranded in central Mozambique at the weekend, when rain washed away a section of the main north- south highway, have now been towed clear by bulldozers.</p>
